# Paragraph publication ID override (optional — defaults to the g-Factor
# publication hardcoded in src/lib/paragraph.ts)
VITE_PARAGRAPH_PUBLICATION_ID=

# NOTE: PARAGRAPH_API_KEY (Phase 4, the newsletter subscribe Function) is a
# Cloudflare Pages secret, not a Vite env var. It must NEVER be prefixed with
# VITE_ — that prefix ships the value in the client bundle. Set it via
# `wrangler pages secret put PARAGRAPH_API_KEY` (or the dashboard) and, for
# local dev, in a gitignored .dev.vars file.

# Analytics (Optional)
VITE_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=jeffdickerson.me
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
